B.aE7=new A.hC("0.1.127","Feature update cards","After an app update, missed features show up in this overlay once. Skipping marks them as seen.",B.aGb)
B.aE6=new A.hC("0.1.129","Add to your Home Screen","Each app now has its own icon and, on phones, suggests adding it to your Home Screen \u2014 an app-like window plus storage the browser won\u2019t evict.",B.Ei)
B.aEb=new A.hC("0.1.143","Choose your language","Settings now has a Language row \u2014 switch the portal between English and \u7b80\u4f53\u4e2d\u6587, or follow your device default.",B.Ey)
